				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-20T07:52:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おっと！
忘れるところでした▼
ほら！　これこれ！　この
ランニングシューズを　どうぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-20T07:52:40" />
