	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c12_oldman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>みはらしだい　からの　けしき……
めのまえに　ひろがる　１９ばんどうろ▽
あれは　ヒオウギの　じまんだな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>見晴台からの　景観……
眼下に　広がる　１９番道路▽
あれは　ヒオウギの　自慢だな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
