			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T06:35:49" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLDMAN1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c12_bigman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かがくの　ちからって　すげー！▼
いまなら　つうしんで
１００にん　どうじに　あそぶことが▽
できるんだってよー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T07:28:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>科学の　力って　すげー！▼
今なら　通信で
１００人同時に　遊ぶことが▽
できるんだってよー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T10:55:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・仮メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T06:35:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BIGMAN
太った青年</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
